            "text": "{\"title\":\"Quick Weeknight Beef Daube with Tender Root Vegetables\",\"readyInMinutes\":45,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003equick weeknight beef daube\u003c/b\u003e delivers all the rich, slow-cooked flavors of a traditional French stew in under an hour. By using tender cuts of sirloin steak and pre-chopped root vegetables, you can create a comforting, hearty meal without spending hours at the stove. The rich sauce is built with a base of red wine, beef stock, tomato paste, and aromatic herbs, giving the dish its signature depth and savory character. A splash of red wine vinegar adds brightness to balance the savory notes, while baby carrots and shallots cook down to sweet perfection. Serve this fragrant stew over a bed of buttery mashed potatoes, egg noodles, or simply alongside a warm, crusty baguette to soak up every drop of the luxurious wine gravy. This recipe offers a clever shortcut approach for busy evenings when you crave authentic \u003cb\u003eFrench comfort food\u003c/b\u003e but lack the time for long braising. Enjoy a restaurant-quality meal right in the comfort of your own kitchen with minimal effort and cleanup required, making it an ideal choice for any family dinner or casual gathering during cold weather nights.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":420,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":18,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":23},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":6,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":30},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":16,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":5},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":6,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":7},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":38,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":76},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":85,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":580,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":25},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":3,\"un